Frame rule (Plan Gate (e), governs per ruling R6): collect the
owner-designating field per source (latest CCAO sale buyer_name;
assessor taxpayer name; CRM grantee/owner if the extract asserts
one), normalize, and the sorted set of distinct normalized names
is the frame. The CRM asserts no owner (null purchaser).

current_owner frame (2 entities): CSMA BLT LLC, FIRSTKEY HOMES
sslbda_disposition frame (2 elements): conveyed, not_conveyed

The chain above has 10 parties; the frame has 2 because only the
latest per-source assertions claim CURRENT ownership. RICHARD
THORTON is an attested alias-table entity and chain-of-title
party, not a frame element: no source asserts him as current
owner (ruling R6).

